    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.poster.avif?t=1723062187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.webm?t=1723062187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.mp4?t=1723062187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Become a void-slaying overlord in Tiny Squads, an auto-battler where your units can be customised and merged, allowing you to design the ultimate team in your vision.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draft Your Perfect Team</h2>Each round gives access to a variety of different units and synergies, offering strong bonuses the more they are used. Customise your units further with powerful skills and randomly-generated equipment to take them to the next level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Units From Scratch</h2>In contrast to most auto battlers, units in Tiny Squads do not have fully predefined traits. Each unit only has a class, but comes with numerous empty slots for you to experiment with and discover synergies on your own.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Choices Each Time</h2>Randomised shops and enemies will force you to change your strategy each time you play. This, together with the customisation, enable a large number of outcomes for each match.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.poster.avif?t=1723062187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.webm?t=1723062187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302310/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.mp4?t=1723062187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Become a void-slaying overlord in Tiny Squads, an auto-battler where your units can be customised and merged, allowing you to design the ultimate team in your vision.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draft Your Perfect Team</h2>Each round gives access to a variety of different units and synergies, offering strong bonuses the more they are used. Customise your units further with powerful skills and randomly-generated equipment to take them to the next level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Units From Scratch</h2>In contrast to most auto battlers, units in Tiny Squads do not have fully predefined traits. Each unit only has a class, but comes with numerous empty slots for you to experiment with and discover synergies on your own.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Choices Each Time</h2>Randomised shops and enemies will force you to change your strategy each time you play. This, together with the customisation, enable a large number of outcomes for each match.",
    "short_description": "Draft a squad of tiny heroes and slay monsters of the Void in this auto-battler rogue-like. Design your own units with an assortment of classes, equipment, skills and unique effects! Merge units to create a monstrous tiny titan!",
